  "releaseNotes": "1.4.12\n        - A close-top (or the hardware back) during a stacked sheet's stage-before-show hold closes THAT sheet, not the one under it; a staged sheet counts as the top.\n        - An empty or blank label no longer hides an outlined field's placeholder.",
